  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The Quick Menu currently has clock variants that display either the date or an accurate time, but there is no human-readable option that displays both the date and seconds.\n\nRFC3339 displays both, but a format such as:\n\nyyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ss+timezone\n\nis difficult to read quickly in VR because of the \"T\" separator and timezone suffix.\n\nPlease add a practical clock format such as:\n\nyyyy/MM/dd HH:mm:ss\n\nAlternatively, allow users to independently enable or disable the date, weekday, seconds, and timezone.\n\nThis would be useful for event timing, scheduled breaks, medication, streaming, and general time management.",
